<span id="S3.F4.p6.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:11.25em;">
<span id="S3.F4.p6.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S3.F4.p6.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool Input
